WEBVTT

cue-1
00:00:00.479 --> 00:00:04.940
Come now, sir. The polling starts soon
enough. You'll vote true blue for the old

cue-2
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:10.760
-interests, sure?
-Perhaps I will, perhaps I won't. We honest

cue-3
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:15.500
farmers always like to do what's in the
best interests of the country, so long as

cue-4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.560
it aligns with my own interests, of
course. I will just say that I have heard

cue-5
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:27.119
-the pie is very good at the inn you keep.
-Aye, so it is. And the ale too.

cue-6
00:00:27.119 --> 00:00:31.600
Here, take this invitation to dine with
us. You shall have whatever you choose, if

cue-7
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:37.459
-you will but promise your vote.
-Nay, sir. You must come to eat at The

cue-8
00:00:37.459 --> 00:00:43.400
Crown, yonder down the street. Our fare is
twice as good as his, and what's much

cue-9
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:48.500
better, you won't have to hold your nose
against the old interest stench. The

cue-10
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:54.580
Crown's where the new interest resorts,
and we will treat you splendidly.

cue-11
00:00:54.580 --> 00:01:00.500
Well, mayhap I may sup at both your inns,
but still, I'm not

cue-12
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:06.099
decided. Is there aught more you could do
to help persuade me how to cast my

cue-13
00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:10.299
-vote?
-Oh, yes, indeed. Here's silver, sir, to

cue-14
00:01:10.299 --> 00:01:15.059
help you know your proper mind. Never let
it be said that we old interest don't know

cue-15
00:01:15.059 --> 00:01:17.619
how to repay loyalty.

cue-16
00:01:18.919 --> 00:01:25.680
Yes, loyal and honest, that's me to a T.
Uh, but tell me, mister, what says the

cue-17
00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:31.540
-new interest?
-Only this, dear sir, that this gold guinea

cue-18
00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:37.119
must eloquently explain why your support
should go to us.

cue-19
00:01:37.119 --> 00:01:42.539
Their bribery has just begun. Why should I
pledge to either one? To each I'll give

cue-20
00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:48.079
my separate oath, so of their bribes, I
may take both.
